  "retained_observations": [
    "First source gate refused unsupported Name extended flag2; actual diagnostic identified confused primaryUPDATABLE2 vs extendedUNICODE_COMPRESSION1. Corrected authored declaration before any producer and kept all assertions.",
    "Equivalent source-model loop enumeration fixed a lint before mutation; literal construction unchanged.",
    "First producer passed5 adversarial/resource tests but differed in16 DATA/footer bytes on the first full image: previous preferred writer chose2-byte raw1char instead of frozen3-byte compact form. Existing goldens were not changed.",
    "Added a distinct capacity-aware mixed encoding policy and independent proof; original preferred/minimum-size consumers remain unchanged. New zero-slack/raw1char cases were frozen and read-qualified before those API calls, preventing unnecessary capacity refusals.",
    "First new zero-slack source constructor used an offset missing3 counter records; corrected that NEW source descriptor offset before its producer. Original39 source/expected constructors unchanged.",
    "All83 complete images then matched; malformed/stale input, correlated selected/unselected/cache tampering, neither-fitting-form, budgets and final cancellation remain refusals."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Exactly one variable group; existing fitting indexes and record capacity only",
    "No new DATA/INDEX pages, map growth or forwarding placement",
    "Normal ACE saves, macro qualification, journaling and native Access evidence remain separate",
    "Adapter/CLI routing not supplied by this engine commit"
  ],
  "native_Access_qualification": false
